{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-threading-link","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:threading-link","kind":"definition","title":"Threading link $T(2,N)$","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-molecular-hopf-chain"],"tags":["threading","torus-link","T26","alexander-polynomial","molecular","ring","non-local","correlated"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Organic.ThreadingLink","text":"threading-link.md","leanSource":"threading-link.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:threading-link\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{A}_1, \\ldots, \\mathcal{A}_N</code> be atoms arranged in a cycle. The <strong>threading link</strong> of the ring is the torus link</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\mathcal{T}_N =  T(2, N),</code></pre>\n<p>presented as the closure <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\hat{\\beta}_N</code> of the braid</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\beta_N\n  = \n  (\\sigma_1  \\sigma_2  \\cdots  \\sigma_{N-1})^2 \\in B_N.</code></pre>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/organic-chemistry/threading-link.md","heading":"Definition","number":"19.2.3","page":"b/def-threading-link","qa":{"counts":{"pass":76,"fail":0,"warn":2,"na":14,"unknown":0,"stale":79},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.Organic.ThreadingLink","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/organic-chemistry/threading-link.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
